   ↓
Recipient
   ↓
Decrypt


Supabase must not be able to read message plaintext.

BLE relay devices must not be able to read message plaintext.

Do not invent cryptographic algorithms.

Use well-maintained cryptographic libraries.

Evaluate bitchat's encryption concepts and protocol architecture, but do not copy incompatible licensed code.

Before reusing any code:

Inspect source.
Inspect license.
